tus-js-client 4.3.1 (tus.min.js)
https://github.com/tus/tus-js-client
Licensed under the MIT License; see tus.LICENSE.

tus.min.js is the unmodified dist/tus.min.js of tus-js-client 4.3.1 from the
npm registry, with only its trailing source map comment removed. It
bundles the following third-party modules, each distributed under its own
license:

js-base64 (3.x)      BSD-3-Clause   Copyright (c) 2014, Dan Kogai
url-parse (1.5.x)    MIT            Copyright (c) 2015 Unshift.io, Arnout Kazemier, the Contributors.
querystringify       MIT            Copyright (c) 2015 Unshift.io, Arnout Kazemier, the Contributors.
requires-port        MIT            Copyright (c) 2015 Unshift.io, Arnout Kazemier, the Contributors.
buffer (6.x)         MIT            Copyright (c) Feross Aboukhadijeh, and other contributors.
base64-js (1.x)      MIT            Copyright (c) 2014 Jameson Little
ieee754 (1.x)        BSD-3-Clause   Copyright 2008 Fair Oaks Labs, Inc.

Full license texts of the bundled modules follow.

